A Batch job specifies a pool to run tasks on and optional settings such as a priority and schedule for the work. The sample creates a job with a call to `CreateJobAsync`. This defined method uses the [BatchClient.CreateJobAsync](/en-us/dotnet/api/azure.compute.batch.batchclient.createjobasync) method to create a job on your pool.

