```

The app creates a reference to the [BatchAccountResource](/en-us/dotnet/api/azure.resourcemanager.batch.batchaccountresource) via the Resource Manager's [ArmClient](/en-us/dotnet/api/azure.resourcemanager.armclient) to create the pool in the Batch service. The Arm client in the sample uses [DefaultAzureCredential](/en-us/dotnet/api/azure.identity.defaultazurecredential) authentication.

